HOST-SUFFIX,anthropic.com,proxy
HOST-SUFFIX,claude.ai,proxy
HOST-SUFFIX,claude.com,proxy
HOST-SUFFIX,claude.app,proxy
HOST-SUFFIX,claudeusercontent.com,proxy
HOST-SUFFIX,claudemcpcontent.com,proxy
HOST-SUFFIX,clau.de,proxy
HOST-SUFFIX,modelcontextprotocol.io,proxy
# Google Cloud Storage 共享主机。Claude Code 用它获取插件元数据，旧版也用它更新。
HOST,storage.googleapis.com,proxy
HOST,cdn.growthbook.io,proxy
HOST,cdn.usefathom.com,proxy
# Anthropic 官方入站网段。
IP-CIDR,160.79.104.0/23,proxy,no-resolve
IP-CIDR,153.61.224.0/22,proxy,no-resolve
IP6-CIDR,2607:6bc0::/48,proxy,no-resolve
